SEC 7  THE PRE-REGISTERED OUTCOME (pin sec.2), decided by predicate
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  OUTCOME: TH-II — non-coboundary, R+-valued, ODD SECTOR EMPTY — the grammar carries genuine MODULUS curvature with no phase

  the predicate, in full:
    non-coboundary on the carrier (non-unit self-loops, which no potential can remove)   = True
    every exhibited holonomy value a positive rational                       = True
    an orientation-sensitive (conjugating) residue exists                    = False
    removable at   ['SEQ', 'REC']
    NOT removable at ['MULT', 'STATE', 'PORT', 'MENU']
    carrier        = the weighted-menu quotient (113 classes at AB4), equivalently the coarsest weighted congruence (185 classes)
    group          = <2, 3> = the FULL group of 2-3-smooth positive rationals (free abelian of rank 2)
    seen / unseen  = 44 curvature-type + 44 descent-obstruction-type defective squares

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
